Except as expressly permitted by Section 4, or by separate Written
Authorization, You may NOT:

a. Copy or redistribute the Engine, in source or object form,
including publishing, uploading, mirroring, or packaging it for
third parties — in whole or in part, original or modified;

b. Modify, adapt, translate, or create derivative works of the
Engine, or distribute an Engine modified by You or for You;

c. Sublicense, sell, rent, lease, lend, or otherwise transfer
rights in the Engine to any third party;

d. Commercially exploit the Engine itself — including charging for
access to it, offering it as a product or hosted service, or
building a competing engine, framework, or SDK upon it. This
subsection restricts the Engine; it does NOT restrict the commercial
distribution or sale of Wallpaper Content, which Section 4(c)
expressly permits;

e. Remove, obscure, or alter any copyright, trademark, or other
proprietary notice contained in the Engine or in an Engine Copy;

f. Reverse engineer, decompile, or disassemble the Engine, except
where, and strictly to the extent, such acts are permitted by
mandatory provisions of applicable law that cannot be waived by
contract;

g. Use the Engine's shipped assets (including its bundled example
themes) outside of Wallpaper Content, or redistribute them as
standalone theme or asset packages.

Access to the Engine's repository — including cloning it, reading
its source, or building it locally — grants only the rights in this
license. Such access does not grant any right to redistribute, reuse,
repackage, or sublicense the Engine beyond Sections 4 and 5, and does
not constitute ownership of any kind.

